            <description><![CDATA[We are excited to announce the launch of ReactPilot, your new AI-powered copilot for React codebases!]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>We are excited to announce the launch of <strong>ReactPilot</strong>, your new AI-powered copilot for React codebases!</p>
<p>ReactPilot helps you analyze, optimize, and fix your React applications with the power of AST analysis and Generative AI.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="key-features">Key Features<a href="https://co-pratham.github.io/reactpilot-docs/blog/reactpilot-launch#key-features" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Key Features" title="Direct link to Key Features" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<ul>
<li class=""><strong>Deep Analysis</strong>: Find bugs that linters miss.</li>
<li class=""><strong>Auto-Fix</strong>: Let AI fix your code for you.</li>
<li class=""><strong>Performance Score</strong>: Gamify your optimization process.</li>
</ul>
<p>Give it a try today!</p>
